{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4001_029umi", "source_sha256": "04111c4f1d18e762f241fda9e664da338e8cdb344b893f15cb756048ce0adacb", "ja": "{$P$}、大変だよ！\n見て、この台本！", "zh": "{$P$}，不好了！\n你看，这份剧本！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4002_p", "source_sha256": "931d83749d18f5cfa26b9d6f56264bd88f39258d406fe3c4d142000612533d72", "ja": "どうしたんだ、海美。\nそれは……次のドラマの台本か？", "zh": "怎么了，海美？\n这是……下一部戏的剧本吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4003_p", "source_sha256": "250bf3e86b23558b4d7e1a69ae28ed5be87fb98bc4d6dca5c1957b3978fad62f", "ja": "ええと、高坂海美は……薄幸で病弱な美少女役か。\n……確かに、大変だ！", "zh": "我看看，高坂海美……饰演体弱多病的美少女吗？\n……确实，大事不好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4004_029umi", "source_sha256": "7865180da86b47274715fc9b86e5c0c5e34f2edb814a3ed777f31301d51224f0", "ja": "でしょ！？\n私、カラダにだけは自信あるんだっ。", "zh": "对吧！？\n我对自己的体力最有信心了，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4005_029umi", "source_sha256": "551eda2c67d4dcd8205cc42551021dc2b8f9db18e015fc51286d72bc0203e02b", "ja": "なのに、病弱な演技なんて……\nどうしたらいいのかな！？", "zh": "但竟然要演出身体虚弱的样子……\n这该怎么办才好！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4006_p", "source_sha256": "806c61a9c1a8d90a662712be7df328d448c3bfce533f68afe57515083d149af1", "ja": "そうだな。まさかそのために、風邪をひくわけにも\nいかないし……。じゃあ、こうしようか。", "zh": "这个嘛，再怎么说也不能为了演戏\n就故意让自己感冒……那就这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4007", "source_sha256": "1a8e7ce3c6f8eac8410fec50de5c56a53e4588d89ac37cf2e2eb32a88d61a1c7", "ja": "思いっきり走る", "zh": "全力奔跑", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4008", "source_sha256": "a332377e46af7c9cfbe47890a353b3492a7ba9b6aae9863bb586d8e27b568135", "ja": "メイクで乗り切れ", "zh": "靠化妆过关", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4009", "source_sha256": "bb1e12a9fe6571ca8b5a54a7d22dbf39999fa70f90c324f08132987744691aa6", "ja": "昼ごはんを抜け", "zh": "不吃午餐", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4100_p", "source_sha256": "68382bb671250027fa6ef8b49a81940201dc0c166bc69bac091491bb8f0d3fb9", "ja": "思いっきり走ってへロヘロになれば、\n自然と弱々しい演技になる……と思う。", "zh": "全力奔跑到筋疲力竭为止，\n自然就能演出虚弱的模样了……我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4101_029umi", "source_sha256": "f2fa23d3612a199e90015cc64ebb731194598563c076c8fbd42328baba114d59", "ja": "そっか～！　それなら、私にもできるよ！\nさっそく、行ってくるね！", "zh": "这样啊～！这个方法我也办得到喔！\n那我马上就去跑步啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4102_p", "source_sha256": "8d7813ca36a9b035253bd38f2fe2d981d33a5d2abcfdada8905ca135f13e5c7b", "ja": "お疲れ、海美！　どうだった？", "zh": "辛苦了，海美！怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4103_029umi", "source_sha256": "7c77d66bf6f558e0b350184fcced2158a68326b7e9dc8a56718e29b5c20ec872", "ja": "つ、疲れた……もう、歩くのも、ムリ……。", "zh": "好、好累……已经、连走都走不动了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4104_029umi", "source_sha256": "864eec25de4f9643df8ffe44727c3e882f34bba32519a5b4a7685f2d46b0b7e9", "ja": "でも……体が重くて動けない、この感じ……。\nなんか、コツが掴めた……かも！", "zh": "但是……身体重到动不了，这种感觉……\n感觉好像抓到诀窍了……吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4200_p", "source_sha256": "d62b6727c7bf00ffb4e71d910137fb05a8cabc2e865c7ceb4e426a59ebda62cf", "ja": "当日は、できるだけ弱々しい印象になるよう、\nメイクさんにお願いしておくとか……。", "zh": "就拜托化妆师，\n当天尽量制造虚弱印象之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4201_029umi", "source_sha256": "4990f4445335f224e284af182744ce25f85a67f19af5b265a8440dde68d156a9", "ja": "おお～……そうだね！　外見が弱々しかったら、\n私でも、それっぽく見えるかもしれないよね！", "zh": "喔喔……对喔！只要外表变得虚弱，\n就算是我，说不定看起来也会有模有样吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4202_029umi", "source_sha256": "87168cc9d7f2b329edf0c0e90b169125dcff040a88ba7294a7f08f64f94c36c8", "ja": "それに私……こう、はかなげ、っていうの？\nそういうの、ちょっと憧れてたんだよね～♪", "zh": "而且我对那个……那是叫做飘缈吗？\n对那种气质有点向往呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4203_029umi", "source_sha256": "7f4bb705edf3a6321984469ae7ee4e9138039ee4175aa06f8d383f377f899fc2", "ja": "なんか、収録が楽しみになってきたかも！\n{$P$}、ありがとねっ♪", "zh": "我有点开始期待拍摄了！\n{$P$}，谢谢你啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4300_p", "source_sha256": "6a8670c59a45bed04bb0aa169ab0c72231b69322cfd22cc8c63577d7cb5103ad", "ja": "当日は、昼ごはんを抜いて撮影にのぞむんだ。\nイヤでも元気が出なくて、弱々しく見えるぞ！", "zh": "当天就不要吃午餐，直接上场拍摄，\n就算你不想也会没精神，看起来会很虚弱喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4301_029umi", "source_sha256": "a2b74c22f41e12a7e6b18810b5c7f55af7ae6569bec6c1d8d76e7f707807f790", "ja": "そ、そんな～！　撮影前に、お昼食べられないの！？\nううっ、想像しただけでグッタリしてきた……。", "zh": "怎、怎么这样～！拍摄前不能吃午餐吗！？\n呜呜，光想像就没力了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4302_p", "source_sha256": "acd3600d827741d69bf0722d407b2efa1c6904e8fb076aae142cab9f099f9b3b", "ja": "もちろん、海美だけにひもじい思いはさせないさ……\n俺もつきあって昼を抜く！　だから、一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "我当然不会让海美一个人饿肚子的……\n我也陪你不吃午餐！所以一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_4303_029umi", "source_sha256": "c72b28234d524cf34dbbe65211fbca2a1f539ade5c98f0b0d03a7639630ea56b", "ja": "{$P$}……！\nわかった、私、頑張るよーっ！", "zh": "{$P$}……！\n知道了，我会加油的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
